<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Duty Free suspended from NZSE.</title>
<headline>NZ Duty Free suspended from NZSE.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Stock Exchange's Market Surveillance Panel said it was suspending trading in New Zealand Duty Free Ltd from close of business on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the company had failed to meet listing requirements that each class of securities be held by at least 500 members of the public, holding at least a quarter of the securities issued.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
